          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好，今天的工作可以结束了。回家吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37403002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "等等，站住。低头，往下看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37403003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "水野梅？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37403004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "为什么你还在这？都说了，我是不会跟你回家的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37403006",
              "text": "我的工作还没完成。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37403006",
              "text": "你会改变主意的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37403005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37403006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水野梅",
          "text": "哼，警告你，别想跟我耍花招！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
